urated insights, exclusive content, and community updates — no spam, just value.</div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class="margin-bottom margin-4"><div class="layout_12-col-grid"><div id="w-node-b0b754bb-799e-09ad-d217-193992f07e28-2e8270ed" data-w-id="b0b754bb-799e-09ad-d217-193992f07e28" style="-webkit-transform:translate3d(0, 20px, 0) scale3d(1, 1, 1) rotateX(0) rotateY(0) rotateZ(0) skew(0, 0);-moz-transform:translate3d(0, 20px, 0) scale3d(1, 1, 1) rotateX(0) rotateY(0) rotateZ(0) skew(0, 0);-ms-transform:translate3d(0, 20px, 0) scale3d(1, 1, 1) rotateX(0) rotateY(0) rotateZ(0) skew(0, 0);transform:translate3d(0, 20px, 0) scale3d(1, 1, 1) rotateX(0) rotateY(0) rotateZ(0) skew(0, 0);opacity:0" class="productfeature_card is-centered"><div class="max-width-400"><div class="margin-bottom margin-1"><h3 class="heading-size-ml">Priority access to events</h3></div><div class="text-color-text-2"><div class="text-size-m is-warm">Be the first to hear about our community dinners, virtual sessions, and industry conferences - hosted by Vertice and leading voices in the space.</div></div></div></div><div id="w-node-b0b754bb-799e-09ad-d217-193992f07e30-2e8270ed" data-w-id="b0b754bb-799e-09ad-d217-193992f07e30" style="-webkit-transform:translate3d(0, 20px, 0) scale3d(1, 1, 1) rotateX(0) rotateY(0) rotateZ(0) skew(0, 0);-moz-transform:translate3d(0, 20px, 0) scale3d(1, 1, 1) rotateX(0) rotateY(0) rotateZ(0) skew(0, 0);-ms-transform:translate3d(0, 20px, 0) scale3d(1, 1, 1) rotateX(0) rotateY(0) rotateZ(0) skew(0, 0);transform:translate3d(0, 20px, 0) scale3d(1, 1, 1) rotateX(0) rotateY(0) rotateZ(0) skew(0, 0);opacity:0" class="card-content_v"><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/66150678cd4993ceaf346c7e/693c3a8fe91a50f05faf7615_AI%20contract-3.webp" loading="lazy" alt="" class="productfeature-hero_img has-border"/></div></div></div></div></div></div></section><div class="section_community"><div class="padding-global"><div class="container-1280"><div class="padding-section-8em"><div class="margin-bottom margin-4"><h2 class="heading-size-ml">What our community says</h2></div><div class="z-index-3"><div class="swiper is-community"><div class="swiper-wrapper is-blog"><div class="swiper-slide blog-card"><div class="community-card"><div class="margin-bottom margin-2"><div class="max-width-300"><p class="community-text">“The Vertice community is an invaluable space to connect with peers, share best practices, and stay informed on market trends while collaborating on real procurement challenges.”</p></div></div><div class="author-wrap"><div class="community-quote_lockup is-left"><img loading="lazy" src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/66150678cd4993ceaf346c7e/67b0f5efa3b03ecab8073a64_Katie.webp" alt="Katie Hodgekiss Headshot" class="report_quote-headshot is-large"/></div><div class="author-details"><div>Katie Hodgkiss</div><div class="text-color-text-2 dark">Global Head of Cloud &amp; Infrastructure Procurement</div></div></div></div></div><div class="swiper-slide blog-card"><div class="community-card"><div class="margin-bottom margin-2"><div class="max-width-300"><p class="community-text">“The Vertice community is a great place to compare modern practices with peers facing similar challenges, pick up practical playbooks and vendor ideas, plus a network to sanity-check strategies.”</p></div></div><div class="author-wrap"><div class="community-quote_lockup is-left"><img loading="lazy" src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/66150678cd4993ceaf346c7e/68c2840325b371feed8fefe4_Mateus%20Gira%CC%83o%20Bueno.webp" alt="" class="report_quote-headshot is-large"/><div class="hide"><div class="report_quote-divider"><div class="icon-embed-medium w-embed"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="100%" height="3em" viewBox="0 0 120 33" fill="none" preserveAspectRatio="xMidYMid meet" aria-hidden="true" role="img">
