</svg></div></div></div></div><div class="author-details"><div>Lee Makaika</div><div class="text-color-text-2 dark">Procurement Analyst at Student Cribs</div></div></div></div></div><div class="swiper-slide blog-card"><div class="community-card"><div class="margin-bottom margin-2"><div class="max-width-300"><p class="community-text">&quot;Came for the insights, stayed from the debates. Finally a community where people speak openly about procurement struggles... and don&#x27;t pretend AI will magically fix everything!&quot;</p></div></div><div class="author-wrap"><div class="community-quote_lockup is-left"><img loading="lazy" src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/66150678cd4993ceaf346c7e/698c9004e6a62167f4da580f_Matthias%20Osmaston.avif" alt="" class="report_quote-headshot is-large"/></div><div class="author-details"><div>Matthias Osmaston</div><div class="text-color-text-2 dark">Senior Strategic Sourcing Specialist at Honeywell Building Solutions</div></div></div></div></div><div class="swiper-slide blog-card"><div class="community-card"><div class="margin-bottom margin-2"><div class="max-width-300"><p class="community-text">&quot;I joined to stay connected to current thinking in procurement, learn from peers, and gain insight and data. It&#x27;s been a valuable space for discussion, insights and practical perspectives.&quot;</p></div></div><div class="author-wrap"><div class="community-quote_lockup is-left"><img loading="lazy" src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/66150678cd4993ceaf346c7e/698c8fc56e1347e45bdec1bc_WhatsApp%20Image%202026-02-03%20at%2015.43.23.avif" alt="" class="report_quote-headshot is-large"/></div><div class="author-details"><div>Nasrin Mozlu</div><div class="text-color-text-2 dark">Procurement Manager at London &amp; Partners</div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class="swiper_buttons"><div class="flex-h _0-25"><div class="community_slide-prev"><div class="size l"><div class="community_button"><div class="icon-embed-1 w-embed">